# The top-level Unity .gitattributes sends *.png and *.stl to Git LFS. The files in
# this folder are small (preview renders, three binary STLs) and must be usable
# without git-lfs: the README's images render on GitHub only when stored as plain
# blobs, and so does GitHub's STL viewer. Store them in git directly.
*.png   -filter -diff -merge -text
*.stl   -filter -diff -merge -text
